WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:01.770
A photo flashes up.

2
00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:05.590
A family, a park, a
small dog at the front.

3
00:00:05.590 --> 00:00:08.080
The teacher says «Décris la photo».

4
00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:09.580
And the clock starts.

5
00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:11.230
You know «à gauche».

6
00:00:11.230 --> 00:00:13.090
You know «au premier plan».

7
00:00:13.090 --> 00:00:14.610
But where do you start,

8
00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:16.230
and what comes next?

9
00:00:16.230 --> 00:00:18.290
So how do you keep talking about a photo

10
00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:20.770
in French when you've only just seen it?

11
00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:23.810
In this mission, you'll
split a picture into zones,

12
00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:26.060
from the foreground to the background.

13
00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:29.060
Then you'll watch one
picnic photo grow into about

14
00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:32.020
a minute of French, step by step.

15
00:00:32.020 --> 00:00:35.090
Your mission: keep
talking about any photo,

16
00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:36.830
from the very first second.
